Temporary on-premises signs
20.18.500 Temporary on-premises signs.
A.	Temporary real estate signs shall comply with the following requirements:
1.	Permit required: no;
2.	Maximum number: no maximum, a minimum of fifty feet is required between each sign;
3.	Maximum sign area: thirty-two square feet for C-1, C-2, C-3, C-4, C-5, Q, M-1, M-2 and M-3 districts; six square feet for all other districts,
